DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45492::$$$message_0429_0000_0000$$$::"They're taking an awfully long time... I thought we were supposed to meet at this onsen. Did we get the wrong place?"::
45493::$$$message_0429_0000_0001$$$::"You worry too much, Mother. I'm sure Father is fine!"::
45494::$$$message_0429_0000_0002$$$::"Let's make our skin all silky smooth in the onsen, and then go greet him!"::
45495::$$$message_0429_0000_0003$$$::"Assassin, is my husband really okay? I'm afraid he might've gotten lost..."::
45496::$$$message_0429_0000_0004$$$::"Be at ease. Our master, Kirei, is accompanying master Tohsaka."::
45497::$$$message_0429_0000_0005$$$::"You can rest assured that he will not allow even the slightest mishap to befall your husband... Whew, so please, take your time and relax... [wvl][hfangry layer=2][se storage=SE_0006.wav]Ahhh, this bath is so nice and warm..."::
45498::$$$message_0429_0000_0006$$$::"I'm just worried because my husband has a habit of making blunders at critical moments."::
45499::$$$message_0429_0000_0007$$$::"I'm normally careful enough for both of us, but when he's out there where I can't keep an eye on him, I worry..."::
45500::$$$message_0429_0000_0008$$$::"We Hassans of the Hundred Personas are on watch all around this onsen. As soon as Master Tokiomi's party is sighted, we will guide him to you."::
45501::$$$message_0429_0000_0009$$$::"Let's just be patient. This is Father we're talking about. We have to always be confident and elegant. Especially at times like this."::
45502::$$$message_0429_0000_0010$$$::"You're so fond of his pet phrase, Rin."::
45503::$$$message_0429_0000_0011$$$::"Of course I am. One day, I'm going to lead the Tohsaka family, just like him!"::
45504::$$$message_0429_0000_0012$$$::"Hehehe. I wish he could hear you say that."::
45505::$$$message_0429_0000_0013$$$::"I-I would never! I'm not even close to ready yet! Uuu..."::
45506::$$$message_0429_0000_0014$$$::"I shall read the room and activate my Presence Concealment skill, so as not to interrupt this harmonious mother-daughter moment. [wvl][hfangry layer=2][se storage=SE_0008.wav](bubble bubble bubble)"::

